Package: datalib
Title: Manage Versioned Survey Microdata Libraries
Version: 0.9.31
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joao Pedro", "Azevedo", email = "jpazevedo@unicef.org", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Client for a standardized, versioned survey microdata library
    (masters and harmonized adaptations) organized as
    <root>/<CCC>/<CCC>_<YYYY>_<SSSS>/<vintage>/Data/Original, Data/Stata and Data/R.
    Enumerates countries, surveys, vintages and adaptations; resolves paths;
    loads and merges survey modules from Stata .dta files. Part of a
    trilingual suite also available for 'Stata' and 'Python'.
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    yaml,
    haven,
    fs
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr (>= 2.5.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
